Colon-fence as a block opener in a list item

```
- one
 ::: note
 b
 :::
.
<ul>
  <li>one</li>
</ul>
<aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
  <p>b</p>
</aside>
```

```
- one
  ::: note
  b
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>one
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
      <p>b</p>
    </aside>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- one
   ::: note
   b
   :::
.
<ul>
  <li>one
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
      <p>b</p>
    </aside>
  </li>
</ul>
```
